# Methods

Methods are functions inside class.

Example:

```javascript
class User {

   constructor(name) {
      this.name = name;
   }

   greet() {
      console.log(
         `Hello ${this.name}`
      );
   }

}
```

---

Create:

```javascript
const user =
 new User("Siddharth");

user.greet();
```

Output:

```text
Hello Siddharth
```

---

# Visual

```text
User
 │
 ├── name
 │
 └── greet()
```

---

# Multiple Objects

One blueprint.

Many objects.

---

Class:

```javascript
class User {

   constructor(name) {
      this.name = name;
   }

}
```

Objects:

```javascript
const user1 =
 new User("John");

const user2 =
 new User("Alex");

const user3 =
 new User("Bob");
```

Output:

```text
John
Alex
Bob
```

Each object has its own data.

