# Common Mistakes

### Forgetting new

Wrong:

```javascript
const user =
 User("John");
```

Error.

---

Correct:

```javascript
const user =
 new User("John");
```

---

### Using Static Method Incorrectly

Wrong:

```javascript
const math =
 new MathUtils();

math.add(1,2);
```

---

Correct:

```javascript
MathUtils.add(1,2);
```

