# Mental Model Cheat Sheet

| Concept       | Meaning                  |
| ------------- | ------------------------ |
| Class         | Blueprint                |
| Object        | Instance                 |
| new           | Creates object           |
| constructor   | Initializes object       |
| this          | Current object           |
| Method        | Function inside class    |
| Static Method | Belongs to class         |
| Getter        | Read property            |
| Setter        | Update property          |
| Encapsulation | Data + Behavior together |

